OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I owe #70k repayments on #42k
OL,4,Astudent loan'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA solicitor from Brighton says her
OL,7,F#600-a-month student loan repayments
OL,8,Fremain "huge" despite paying back tens
OL,9,Fof thousands of pounds and it's
OL,10,F"unfair" she will continue accruing
OL,11,Finterest while on maternity leave.
OL,13,FPolly Fletcher borrowed #42,000 to fund
OL,14,Fher degree, but while she has already
OL,15,Fmade repayments totalling #48,000 over
OL,16,Fthe past decade, the interest added
OL,17,Fmeans she still owes #21,500 today, but
OL,18,Fthat will continue to increase.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
